#. Tag: title
#: dcop.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scripting &kmplot;"
msgstr "Skriptiranje &kmplot;"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:3
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A new feature in &kde; 3.4 is that you can write scripts for &kmplot; using "
"&DBus; in &kde; 4. For example, if you want to define a new function "
"<userinput>f(x)=2sin x+3cos x</userinput>, set its line width to 20 and then "
"draw it, you type in a console:"
msgstr ""
"Novi dodatak u  &kde; 3.4 je to što možete pisati skripte za  &kmplot; "
"koristeći &DBus; u &kde; 4.  Na prijmjer, ako želite deinisati svoju "
"funkciju <userinput>f(x)=2sin x+3cos x</userinput>, postavlja njenu širinu "
"linije na 20 i cirta je, vi kcate u konzoli:"

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>qdbus org.kde.kmplot-PID /parser org.kde.kmplot.Parser.addFunction "
"\"f(x)=2sin x+3cos x\" \"\"</command> As a result, the new function's id "
"number will be returned, or -1 if the function could not be defined."
msgstr ""
"<command>qdbus org.kde.kmplot-PID /parser org.kde.kmplot.Parser.addFunction "
"\"f(x)=2sin x+3cos x\" \"\"</command> Kao rezultat, biće vraćen ID broj nove "
"funkcije ili -1 ako funkcija ne može biti definisana."

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>qdbus org.kde.kmplot-PID /parser org.kde.kmplot.Parser."
"setFunctionFLineWidth ID 20</command> This command sets the function with "
"the id number ID the line width to 20."
msgstr ""
"<command>qdbus org.kde.kmplot-PID /parser org.kde.kmplot.Parser."
"setFunctionFLineWidth ID 20</command> Ova komanda postavlja debljinu linije "
"funkcije sa zadanim ID brojem na 20."

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:9
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>qdbus org.kde.kmplot-PID /view org.kde.kmplot.View.drawPlot</"
"command> This command repaints the window so that the function get visible."
msgstr ""
"<command>qdbus org.kde.kmplot-PID /view org.kde.kmplot.View.drawPlot</"
"command> Ova komanta resetuje prozor tako da funkcija postaje vidljiva."

#. Tag: para
#: dcop.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "A list of the available functions:"
msgstr "Lista dostupnih funkcija:"

